task-board spawn TASK-ID --role developer --background --agent agy --model gemini-3.6-flash-high --timeout 35m
```

`agy` takes no `--reasoning-effort`; effort is encoded in its eight scoped
model IDs. Minimum `agy` is 1.1.12; 1.1.14 is validated. Prompt delivery has
a 96 KiB argv budget; `SUCCESS`/`ERROR` JSON overrides process exit. Only the
top-level worker is tracked. See [README](README.md) for the full models,
flags, JSON, safety, configuration, and Gemini compatibility contract.

