# TASK-260830-1r9wrr outcome — implement-session-state-reducer

**Status: ready for review.** New package `internal/sessstate` derives all
`SessionState` values, winning epochs, conflicts, current checkpoints,
provider identity, and terminal binding from the immutable records, through
the production entries, with every number below re-derived after the last
artifact. `internal/sessrepo` production is untouched; `internal/provhost`
is untouched.

## What was built

`internal/sessstate/` (14 files, +4823 lines, no deletions elsewhere):

