- `sessstate.go` — `Reduce` (pure: record + authoritative events + union +
  local lease/host + parked channel → `Projection`), the Section 5.7 table
  as the single enforced source, tuple winner resolution with five named
  conflict rules, checkpoint/provider/binding derivation, local stale
  override and role.
- `decode.go` — `DecodeRecord`/`DecodeEvent`: member projection from
